ara-ai/omnara\" target=\"_blank\">Omnara</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        AI agent platform that syncs across terminal, web dashboard, and mobile with Claude Code integration - YC S25 startup.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span class=\"source\">GitHub</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-26</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"YC S25 startup\"</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Product Updates <span class=\"section-count\">(5)</span></h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</span>: Visual Studio April Update\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        April 2026 update centers on agentic workflows: cloud agent sessions launch directly from IDE, custom agents gain user-level support in %USERPROFILE%/.github/agents/, new Debugger agent validates fixes against live runtime behavior, customizable keyboard shortcuts, new chat history panel, and C++ code editing tools now generally available.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span class=\"date-badge\">2026-04-30</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-30-github-copilot-in-visual-studio-april-update/\" target=\"_blank\">View Changelog →</a>\n                    </div>\n                </di